      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAY THE REG (7) jumped cleanly from the rails last start to lead all the way and score (26.39) at this track in a T3 RSTW over 460m. The form out of her last race has been franked. Expected to be right there at the finish again. MIGHTY HERCULES (6) turned in a plain effort last time when fifth at this track over 460m behind Darnum Rain (26.80) in a Grade 5. Was a winner the start prior. The form from his last run stacks up well. Has the ability to give this a shake. DR. AXEL (1) has been hard to follow lately, running fourth (24.65) last time but prior to that ran very well when placed at this track. Can feature with the right run. MRS. TIGGYWINKLE (2) has claims again if she runs up to the latest effort.",
